      &quot;model&quot;: &quot;gemini-4-hydrogen&quot;,
      &quot;input&quot;: &quot;If it&#39;\&#39;&#39;s warmer than 20°C in London, set the thermostat to 20°C, otherwise 18°C.&quot;,
